Key JavaScript Functions
​Audio Engine (AudioContext API)
​playHonkSound(): Generates a two-tone car horn sound purely with code (no external sound files needed).
​playPopSound(): Produces a quick popping noise when you tap a floating soap bubble.
​unlockAudio(): Unlocks browser audio restrictions on the user's first click.
​Car Animation (triggerCarAnimation())
​Animates the car driving from left to right across the road strip.
​Pauses the car halfway across the screen to trigger the horn animation and sound before driving off.
​Floating Soap Bubbles (createBubble())
​Spawns random-sized bubbles at the bottom of the screen every 400 milliseconds.
​Adds an interactive click event so bubbles pop and play a sound effect when tapped.
​Live Cost Calculator (calculateTotal())
​Listens for checkbox clicks in the estimator section.
​Adds up all selected car wash and food prices, updating the total amount in Rands (R) instantly.
​Booking Handler (handleBooking())
​Prevents default page reloads on form submission and displays a confirmation alert with the customer's name.
